<title>SPAIN: BASKETBALL-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GERONA, Spain 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the European basketball championship on Thursday:</p>
<p>Group A (in Gerona):</p>
<p>Turkey 70 Bosnia 62 (halftime 29-26)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Turkey - Ufuk Sarica 17, Orhun Ene 16, Harun Erdenay 9, Tamer Oyguc 8, Mirsad Turkcan 7</p>
<p>Bosnia - Nenad Markovic 17, Gordan Firic 17, Samir Avdic 11, Aris Beciragic 8, Sejo Bukva 8.  </p>
<p>Group C (in Badalona):</p>
<p>Poland 86 Latvia 79 (50-36)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Poland - Adam Wojcik 21, Dominik Tomczyk 12, Maciej Zielinski 12, Piotr Szybilski 11, Andrzej Pluta 10.</p>
<p>Latvia - Robert Stelmahers 18, Ainars Bagatskis 13, Raimond Miglinieks 11, Ralf Jansons 9, Edgar Sneps 8.</p>
